<title>USA: Franklin Cty SDFC, Ky., won by William R Hough.</title>
<headline>Franklin Cty SDFC, Ky., won by William R Hough.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R Hough &amp; Co said it won $3.505 million of Franklin County School District Finance Corp, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series of 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.402 percent.</p>
</text>
